			"Message": "docs(Common): Revise CHANGELOG with narrative formatting\n\nRestructure the CHANGELOG to use a more readable, narrative-driven\nformat inspired by Keep a Changelog. Changes include:\n\n- Add introductory paragraph explaining Common's purpose\n- Rewrite version headers from [Common/vX.X] to [vX.X]\n- Convert bullet-point changes to flowing prose descriptions\n- Align all version entries with consistent voice and structure\n\nThe revision improves readability while preserving all historical\nchange information.",
